 justice center there's  again  a lot of free resources out there for  families that are under tremendous  stress  in an effort where those resources could  potentially prevent  a situation like this from happening i'm  sorry if you said it the age of the son  he's a teenager their daughter  was also here the only people who were  present at the time  was the teenage son and the mother and  father  all right thank you guys appreciate it  they both are diseased  yes they are both deceased inside the  house thank you all right thank you
 

